      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.27 (vs ₹1.78 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.27 (up from ₹1.78 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.01b (up 21% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹23.7m (up ₹57.0m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.3% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 49% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 7% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
