      "date": "2025-11-20T11:26:30.000Z",
      "title": "Insider recently sold ₹44m worth of stock",
      "body": "On the 18th of November, Dineshchandra Patel sold around 520k shares on-market at roughly ₹85.00 per share. This transaction amounted to 100% of their direct individual holding at the time of the trade. This was the largest sale by an insider in the last 3 months. Insiders have been net sellers, collectively disposing of ₹52m more than they bought in the last 12 months.",
